---
import Arrow from '../Arrow.astro';
import SectionBadge from '../SectionBadge.astro';
---
<section class="problem-intro" id="the-problem" aria-labelledby="home-problem-title">
  <div class="problem-intro__panel">
    <div class="problem-intro__heading">
      <SectionBadge>The Problem</SectionBadge>
      <h2 id="home-problem-title">Your plans can change.<br /><span>Your stake’s <wbr />term doesn’t.</span></h2>
      <p>Staking commits your WISE to a timeline. But life doesn’t always follow the same plan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-intro__points">
      <div class="problem-intro__point">
        <span class="problem-intro__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="11" rx="2" /><path d="M8 10V6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4M12 14v3" /></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Leaving early costs principal.</h3><p>Ending an active WISE stake before maturity incurs a principal penalty and stops its future rewards.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-intro__point">
        <span class="problem-intro__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3 10 5-10 5L2 8l10-5Zm-10 9 10 5 10-5M2 16l10 5 10-5" /></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Starting again can mean fewer shares.</h3><p>If the share price has risen, the same principal and bonuses buy fewer shares in a new stake. An earlier stake can retain more earning weight while it remains active.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-intro__footer">
      <p>What if the stake could keep going, with a new owner?</p>
      <a href="/problem"><span>Explore the problem</span><Arrow /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .problem-intro { padding: 36px var(--pad) 28px; scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header) + 24px); }
  .problem-intro__panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); column-gap: clamp(32px,5vw,88px); padding: clamp(28px,3.5vw,56px); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--orange-ink) 22%,transparent); border-radius: 18px; background: linear-gradient(115deg,#dceee8,var(--tile)); }
  .problem-intro h2 { font-size: clamp(32px,3.4vw,52px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.025em; text-wrap: balance; margin: 22px 0; }
  .problem-intro h2 span { color: var(--orange-ink); }
  .problem-intro p { color: var(--grey-text); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .problem-intro__heading > p { max-width: 39ch; }
  .problem-intro__points { align-self: center; }
  .problem-intro__point { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 20px; padding-block: 26px; }
  .problem-intro__point:first-child { padding-top: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .problem-intro__point:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .problem-intro__icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; background: color-mix(in srgb,var(--orange-ink) 8%,transparent); color: var(--orange-ink); border-radius: 12px; }
  .problem-intro__icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  .problem-intro h3 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 12px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .problem-intro__footer { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .problem-intro__footer p { color: var(--ink); font-size: 20px; }
  .problem-intro__footer a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; min-height: 44px; color: var(--orange-ink); font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .problem-intro__footer a span { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 5px; text-decoration-color: transparent; }
  .problem-intro__footer a:hover span { text-decoration-color: currentColor; }
  .problem-intro__footer a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 5px; border-radius: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .problem-intro__panel { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 30px; }
    .problem-intro__heading > p { max-width: 58ch; }
    .problem-intro__footer { margin-top: 0; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .problem-intro { padding-block: 24px 20px; }
    .problem-intro__panel { padding: 24px; border-radius: 14px; }
    .problem-intro p { font-size: 17px; }
    .problem-intro h3 { font-size: 22px; }
    .problem-intro__point { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .problem-intro__footer p { font-size: 19px; }
  }
</style>
